data through one Blockscout PRO API key with expanded rate limits, unified billing, and REST plus RPC endpoints.\",\"icon\":\"circle-info\",\"href\":\"/devs/pro-api\"},{\"title\":\"Make Your First Call\",\"description\":\"Make your first Blockscout PRO API request with a worked curl example and a parameter breakdown.\",\"icon\":\"phone\",\"href\":\"/make-your-first-call\"},{\"title\":\"Best Practices\",\"description\":\"Practical tips for faster, more efficient Blockscout PRO API requests, from pagination to credit costs.\",\"icon\":\"gear-api\",\"href\":\"/best-practices\"},{\"title\":\"PRO API authorization, response headers, and routes\",\"description\":\"Reference for Blockscout PRO API authorization, response headers, route list, pagination, and credit costs for REST and RPC endpoints.\",\"icon\":\"circle-nodes\",\"href\":\"/devs/pro-api-responses-and-routes\"},{\"title\":\"Error Handling\",\"description\":\"How the Blockscout PRO API returns proxied responses and structured error objects with error and source fields for internal vs upstream failures.\",\"icon\":\"blueberries\",\"href\":\"/devs/error-responses\"},{\"title\":\"Multichain Service\",\"description\":\"Aggregate hashes, tokens, and addresses across chains behind one Blockscout endpoint for unified search, token discovery, and multichain UX.\",\"icon\":\"route\",\"href\":\"/devs/multichain-service\"},{\"title\":\"Metadata Service\",\"description\":\"Blockscout Metadata service turns raw addresses into human-readable name tags, protocols, categories, risk flags, and ecosystem labels.\",\"icon\":\"database\",\"href\":\"/devs/metadata-service\"},{\"title\":\"API for AI Agents\",\"description\":\"Give AI agents structured onchain data across 100+ EVM chains with Blockscout PRO API and MCP server for decoded transactions and metadata.\",\"icon\":\"trian-balbot\",\"href\":\"/devs/api-for-ai-agents\"},{\"title\":\"x402 payments for the Blockscout Pro API\",\"description\":\"Use the x402 HTTP payment protocol to pay per call for the Blockscout Pro API with stablecoins, letting autonomous agents access data without an API key.\",\"icon\":\"money-bill-transfer\",\"href\":\"/devs/x402-payments\"},{\"title\":\"WebSocket API\",\"description\":\"Subscribe to real-time blockchain events like new blocks, transactions, and balance changes over a single multiplexed WebSocket connection.\",\"icon\":\"wrench\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/websocket-api\"},{\"title\":\"WebSocket Use Case: Build a Whale-Watching Alert Bot\",\"description\":\"Build a whale-watching bot on Robinhood Chain that streams Blockscout WebSocket events and posts Discord alerts when transfers cross your threshold.\",\"icon\":\"whale\",\"href\":\"/whale-watch\"},{\"group\":\"Chain Specific API info\",\"icon\":\"link-horizontal\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Optimism API\",\"description\":\"Free Optimism (OP Mainnet) block explorer API from Blockscout with REST, JSON RPC, and ETH RPC endpoints. Superchain-ready, multichain PRO API.\",\"href\":\"/optimism-api\"},{\"title\":\"Base API\",\"description\":\"Free Base L2 block explorer API from Blockscout with REST, JSON RPC, and ETH RPC endpoints. No paywall on core methods, multichain-ready PRO API.\",\"href\":\"/base-api\"},{\"title\":\"Soneium API\",\"description\":\"Blockscout is Soneium's primary block explorer. Full API access for Sony's OP Stack Ethereum L2 mainnet and Minato testnet with free and paid tiers.\",\"href\":\"/soneium-api\"},{\"title\":\"Robinhood API\",\"description\":\"Free Robinhood Chain block explorer API from Blockscout, the official explorer for Robinhood's Arbitrum Orbit L2 for tokenized stocks and RWAs.\",\"href\":\"/robinhood-api\"}]}]},{\"title\":\"Dev Portal\",\"description\":\"Blockscout developer portal at dev.blockscout.com where developers sign up, manage PRO API keys, and monitor usage across supported chains.\",\"icon\":\"torii-gate\",\"href\":\"/devs/dev-portal\"},{\"title\":\"Migrate from Etherscan to Blockscout PRO API\",\"description\":\"Move Etherscan API calls to the Blockscout PRO API with matching endpoints, more chains, higher rate limits, and lower pricing in minutes.\",\"icon\":\"person-running-fast\",\"href\":\"/devs/migrate-from-etherscan\"},{\"group\":\"Use Cases\",\"icon\":\"user-chef\",\"pages\":[{\"icon\":\"hat-chef\",\"title\":\"Blockscout PRO API use cases overview\",\"description\":\"Explore example Blockscout PRO API use cases including wallet history trackers, multichain stats dashboards, and crypto tax calculators.\",\"href\":\"/devs/use-cases-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Show wallet history with the Blockscout REST API\",\"description\":\"Fetch balances, transactions, token transfers, and NFT activity for a wallet or portfolio tracker using Blockscout REST API and PRO endpoints.\",\"icon\":\"wallet\",\"href\":\"/devs/wallet-history\"},{\"title\":\"Build a multichain stats dashboard\",\"description\":\"Build a multichain daily transaction dashboard using the Blockscout PRO API and REST stats endpoints across supported networks with one API key.\",\"icon\":\"chart-line\",\"href\":\"/devs/stats-dashboard\"},{\"title\":\"Build a crypto tax calculator with PRO API\",\"description\":\"Fetch full wallet history including transactions, internal txs, and token transfers across chains with the Blockscout PRO API for tax reporting.\",\"icon\":\"calculator\",\"href\":\"/devs/tax-calculator\"}]}]},{\"group\":\"PRO API Endpoints\",\"icon\":\"rectangle-pro\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"MultichainDomains\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Get detailed information about main address of requested name\",\"description\":null,\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /services/bens/api/v1/addresses/{address}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/multichaindomains/get-detailed-information-about-main-address-of-requested-name\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Perform batch resolving of list of addresses to names for blockscout backend requests\",\"description\":nul