csv-exports/{request_id}`; otherwise the CSV body is streamed inline.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/advanced-filters/csv\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/advanced-filters/export-advanced-filter-results-as-csv\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List known contract methods\",\"description\":\"Returns a list of known contract methods. When the `q` parameter is provided, searches for a single method by its 4-byte selector or name. Without `q`, returns the default list of popular methods.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/advanced-filters/methods\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/advanced-filters/list-known-contract-methods\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"arbitrum\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"List batches.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a paginated list of Arbitrum batches committed to the Parent chain.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/arbitrum/batches\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/list-batches\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get batches count.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the total count of Arbitrum batches committed to the Parent chain.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/arbitrum/batches/count\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/get-batches-count\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get batch by AnyTrust data hash.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves an Arbitrum batch associated with the given AnyTrust data hash. By default, returns the most recently associated batch. When `type=all`, returns a paginated list of all batches referencing this data hash.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/arbitrum/batches/da/anytrust/{data_hash}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/get-batch-by-anytrust-data-hash\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get batch by Celestia blob reference.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves an Arbitrum batch whose data availability blob is identified by the given Celestia block height and transaction commitment hash.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/arbitrum/batches/da/celestia/{height}/{transaction_commitment}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/get-batch-by-celestia-blob-reference\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get batch by EigenDA data hash.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves an Arbitrum batch associated with the given EigenDA data hash. By default, returns the most recently associated batch. When `type=all`, returns a paginated list of all batches referencing this data hash.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/arbitrum/batches/da/eigenda/{data_hash}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/get-batch-by-eigenda-data-hash\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get batch by number.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves detailed information about an Arbitrum batch by its number.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/arbitrum/batches/{batch_number}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/get-batch-by-number\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get claim data for a withdrawal.\",\"description\":\"Returns the ABI-encoded calldata and outbox contract address required to execute a Rollup withdrawal on the Parent chain.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/arbitrum/messages/claim/{message_id}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/get-claim-data-for-a-withdrawal\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get withdrawal messages for a transaction.\",\"description\":\"Returns the list of Rollup withdrawal messages (L2ToL1Tx events) emitted by the given transaction.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/arbitrum/messages/withdrawals/{transaction_hash}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/get-withdrawal-messages-for-a-transaction\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List cross-chain messages.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a paginated list of Arbitrum cross-chain messages filtered by the specified direction.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/arbitrum/messages/{direction}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/list-cross-chain-messages\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get cross-chain messages count.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the total count of Arbitrum cross-chain messages for the specified direction.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/arbitrum/messages/{direction}/count\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/get-cross-chain-messages-count\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List committed batches on the main page.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a list of Arbitrum batches that have been committed to the Parent chain, displayed on the main page.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/main-page/arbitrum/batches/committed\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/list-committed-batches-on-the-main-page\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get the latest batch number.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the number of the most recent Arbitrum batch submitted to the Parent chain. Returns 0 if no batches exist.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/main-page/arbitrum/batches/latest-number\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/get-the-latest-batch-number\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List recent Parent chain to Rollup messages on the main page.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the most recent relayed messages from Parent chain to Rollup, displayed on the main page.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/main-page/arbitrum/messages/to-rollup\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/arbitrum/list-recent-parent-chain-to-rollup-messages-on-the-main-page\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"beacon_deposits\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Lists all beacon deposits\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a paginated list of all beacon deposits.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/beacon/deposits\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/beacon_deposits/lists-all-beacon-deposits\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Gets total count of beacon deposits\",\"description\":\"Retrieves the total count of beacon deposits.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/beacon/deposits/count\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/beacon_deposits/gets-total-count-of-beacon-deposits\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"blocks\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"List blocks with optional filtering by block type\",\"description\":\"Retrieves a paginated list of blocks ordered by descending block number.\\n\\nWhen the `type` query parameter is omitted, only main-chain consensus blocks\\n(equivalent to `type=block`) are returned. Use `type=uncle` to list ommer\\nblocks (valid but not in the main chain) and `type=reorg` to list blocks\\nthat lost consensus during a chain reorganization.\\n\\nPagination is cursor-based: the response contains `next_page_params` with\\n`block_number` — pass these back as query parameters on\\nthe next request to fetch the following page.\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/blocks\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/blocks/list-blocks-with-optional-filtering-by-block-type\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List L2 blocks in an Arbitrum batch\",\"description\":\"Retrieves L2 blocks that are bound to a specific Arbitrum batch number.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/blocks/arbitrum-batch/{batch_number_param}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/blocks/list-l2-blocks-in-an-arbitrum-batch\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List L2 blocks in an Optimism batch\",\"description\":\"Retrieves L2 blocks that are bound to a specific Optimism batch number.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/blocks/optimism-batch/{batch_number_param}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/blocks/list-l2-blocks-in-an-optimism-batch\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List L2 blocks in a Scroll batch\",\"description\":\"Retrieves L2 blocks that are bound to a specific Scroll batch number.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/blocks/scroll-batch/{batch_number_param}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/blocks/list-l2-blocks-in-a-scroll-batch\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Retrieves detailed information for a specific block identified by its number or hash.\",\"description\":\"Retrieves detailed information for a specific block, including transactions, internal transactions, and metadata.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/blocks/{block_hash_or_number_param}\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/blocks/retrieves-detailed-information-for-a-specific-block-identified-by-its-number-or-hash\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List beacon deposits in a specific block\",\"description\":\"Retrieves beacon deposits included in a specific block with pagination support.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/blocks/{block_hash_or_number_param}/beacon/deposits\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/blocks/list-beacon-deposits-in-a-specific-block\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List internal transactions in a specific block\",\"description\":\"Retrieves internal transactions included in a specific block with optional filtering by type and call type.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/blocks/{block_hash_or_number_param}/internal-transactions\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/blocks/list-internal-transactions-in-a-specific-block\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List transactions and tx details included in a specific block\",\"description\":\"Retrieves transactions included in a specific block, ordered by transaction index.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/blocks/{block_hash_or_number_param}/transactions\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/blocks/list-transactions-and-tx-details-included-in-a-specific-block\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List validator withdrawals including amounts, index and receiver details processed in a specific block\",\"description\":\"Retrieves withdrawals processed in a specific block (typically for proof-of-stake networks).\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/Master-pro-api.json get /{chain_id}/api/v2/blocks/{block_hash_or_number_param}/withdrawals\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/blocks/list-validator-withdrawals-including-amounts-index-and-receiver-details-processed-in-a-specific-block\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get countdown information for a target block number\",\"description\":\"Calculates the estimated time remaining until a specified block number is reached based on