see the [PRO API reference page](https://docs.blockscout.com/devs/pro-api-responses-and-routes) for information.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/openapi-deprecation.yaml get /config/json-rpc-url\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/get-json-rpc-url\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"get withdrawals\",\"description\":\"**Deprecation Notice:** Per instance endpoints will be deprecated soon in favor of PRO API endpoints. Please see the [PRO API reference page](https://docs.blockscout.com/devs/pro-api-responses-and-routes) for information.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/openapi-deprecation.yaml get /withdrawals\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/get-withdrawals\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"get account abstraction indexing status\",\"description\":\"**Deprecation Notice:** Per instance endpoints will be deprecated soon in favor of PRO API endpoints. Please see the [PRO API reference page](https://docs.blockscout.com/devs/pro-api-responses-and-routes) for information.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/openapi-deprecation.yaml get /proxy/account-abstraction/status\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/get-account-abstraction-indexing-status\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"CelestiaService\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Get apiv1celestiablob\",\"description\":\"**Deprecation Notice:** Per instance endpoints will be deprecated soon in favor of PRO API endpoints. Please see the [PRO API reference page](https://docs.blockscout.com/devs/pro-api-responses-and-routes) for information.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/openapi-deprecation.yaml get /api/v1/celestia/blob\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/celestiaservice/get-apiv1celestiablob\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get apiv1celestial2batchmetadata\",\"description\":\"**Deprecation Notice:** Per instance endpoints will be deprecated soon in favor of PRO API endpoints. Please see the [PRO API reference page](https://docs.blockscout.com/devs/pro-api-responses-and-routes) for information.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/openapi-deprecation.yaml get /api/v1/celestia/l2BatchMetadata\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/celestiaservice/get-apiv1celestial2batchmetadata\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"If the requested service is unknown, the call will fail with status\\nNOT_FOUND.\",\"description\":\"**Deprecation Notice:** Per instance endpoints will be deprecated soon in favor of PRO API endpoints. Please see the [PRO API reference page](https://docs.blockscout.com/devs/pro-api-responses-and-routes) for information.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/openapi-deprecation.yaml get /health\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/celestiaservice/if-the-requested-service-is-unknown-the-call-will-fail-with-statusnot_found\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]}]},{\"title\":\"Stats API\",\"description\":\"REST endpoints from the Blockscout stats microservice exposing precomputed chain statistics and analytics collected from an explorer instance.\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/rest/stats-api\"},{\"title\":\"Interpreter API\",\"description\":\"REST endpoint that returns human-readable summaries of Blockscout transactions and addresses using decoded contract calls and metadata.\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/rest/interpreter-api\"}]},{\"group\":\"JSON RPC \u0026 ETH Compatible RPC Endpoints\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"JSON RPC \u0026 ETH Compatible RPC Endpoints\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Overview\",\"description\":\"JSON-RPC and Ethereum-compatible RPC endpoints for Blockscout, designed for developers migrating from Etherscan with GET and POST support.\",\"icon\":\"exchange-alt\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/rpc\"},{\"title\":\"Account module RPC endpoints\",\"description\":\"Reference for the Blockscout account RPC module, including endpoints for address balances, transactions, token transfers, and mined blocks.\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/rpc/account\"},{\"title\":\"Block module RPC endpoints\",\"description\":\"Reference for the Blockscout block RPC module, covering endpoints for block rewards, uncle rewards, and block lookups by number or timestamp.\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/rpc/block\"},{\"title\":\"Contract module RPC endpoints\",\"description\":\"Reference for the Blockscout contract RPC module with endpoints for listing contracts, source code, ABIs, and smart contract verification.\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/rpc/contract\"},{\"title\":\"Logs module RPC endpoints\",\"description\":\"Reference for the Blockscout logs RPC module and its getLogs endpoint for querying event logs by address, block range, and topic filters.\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/rpc/logs\"},{\"title\":\"Stats module RPC endpoints\",\"description\":\"Reference for the Blockscout stats RPC module with endpoints for token supply, native coin supply, market cap, and chain-level statistics.\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/rpc/stats\"},{\"title\":\"Token module RPC endpoints\",\"description\":\"Reference for the Blockscout token RPC module, including endpoints returning ERC-20 and ERC-721 name, symbol, supply, and holder data.\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/rpc/token\"},{\"title\":\"Transaction module RPC endpoints\",\"description\":\"Reference for the Blockscout transaction RPC module with endpoints for transaction info, receipt status, logs, and confirmations by hash.\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/rpc/transaction\"},{\"title\":\"ETH RPC API\",\"description\":\"Reference for the 16 Ethereum JSON-RPC 2.0 methods supported by Blockscout, available via the PRO API and per-instance eth-rpc endpoints.\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/rpc/eth-rpc\"},{\"group\":\"ETH RPC Endpoint Testing\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"Account\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Get ETH Balance (JSON-RPC Format)\",\"description\":\"Mimics Ethereum JSON RPC's eth_getBalance\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=eth_get_balance\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-eth-balance-json-rpc-format\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Native Token Balance for a Single Address\",\"description\":\"Returns the native token balance of a given address. Results are returned in wei.\\nMany chains use their own native tokens (e.g., ETH on Ethereum, xDai on Gnosis).\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=balance\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-native-token-balance-for-a-single-address\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Balance for Multiple Addresses in a Single Call\",\"description\":\"Returns the balance of multiple accounts from a list of addresses (max 20 addresses)\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=balancemulti\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-balance-for-multiple-addresses-in-a-single-call\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get a List of Transactions by Address\",\"description\":\"Returns up to a maximum of 10,000 transactions for a given address.\\nAlso available through a GraphQL 'address' query.\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=txlist\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-a-list-of-transactions-by-address\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get a List of Internal Transactions\",\"description\":\"Returns up to a maximum of 10,000 internal transactions.\\nAlso available through a GraphQL 'transaction' query.\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=txlistinternal\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-a-list-of-internal-transactions\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get ERC-20 Token Transfer Events by Address\",\"description\":\"Returns up to a maximum of 10,000 ERC-20 token transfer events.\\nAlso available through the GraphQL token_transfers query.\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=tokentx\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-erc-20-token-transfer-events-by-address\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get ERC-721 Token Transfer Events by Address\",\"description\":\"Returns ERC-721 (NFT) token transfer events\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=tokennfttx\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-erc-721-token-transfer-events-by-address\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get ERC-1155 Token Transfer Events by Address\",\"description\":\"Returns ERC-1155 (multi-token) transfer events\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=token1155tx\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-erc-1155-token-transfer-events-by-address\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get ERC-404 Token Transfer Events by Address\",\"description\":\"Returns ERC-404 (hybrid fungible/non-fungible) transfer events\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=token404tx\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-erc-404-token-transfer-events-by-address\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get ERC-20 Token Balance for a Single Address\",\"description\":\"Returns the token balance for a specific token contract and address\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=tokenbalance\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-erc-20-token-balance-for-a-single-address\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"List Accounts and Native Balances\",\"description\":\"Lists accounts and native balances, sorted ascending by the time they were first seen\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=listaccounts\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/list-accounts-and-native-balances\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Pending Transactions for an Address\",\"description\":\"Returns pending transactions for a given address\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=pendingtxlist\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-pending-transactions-for-an-address\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get List of Blocks Mined by Address\",\"description\":\"Returns list of blocks mined by a given address.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=account\u0026action=getminedblocks\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/account/get-list-of-blocks-mined-by-address\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Block\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Get Block Reward by Block Number\",\"description\":\"Returns the block reward and uncle block rewards when applicable\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=block\u0026action=getblockreward\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/block/get-block-reward-by-block-number\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Estimated Block Countdown Time by Block Number\",\"description\":\"Returns the estimated time remaining, in seconds, until a certain block is mined\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=block\u0026action=getblockcountdown\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/block/get-estimated-block-countdown-time-by-block-number\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Block Number by Timestamp\",\"description\":\"Returns the block number that was mined at a certain timestamp\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=block\u0026action=getblocknobytime\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/block/get-block-number-by-timestamp\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Latest Block Number (JSON-RPC Format)\",\"description\":\"Mimics Ethereum JSON RPC's eth_blockNumber\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=block\u0026action=eth_block_number\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/block/get-latest-block-number-json-rpc-format\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Contract\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Get Contract ABI for Verified Contract\",\"description\":\"Returns the Contract Application Binary Interface (ABI) of a verified smart contract.\\nAlso available through a GraphQL 'addresses' query.\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=contract\u0026action=getabi\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/contract/get-contract-abi-for-verified-contract\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Contract Source Code for Verified Contract\",\"description\":\"Returns the Solidity source code of a verified smart contract.\\nAlso available through a GraphQL 'addresses' query.\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=contract\u0026action=getsourcecode\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/contract/get-contract-source-code-for-verified-contract\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Contract Creator and Creation Transaction Hash\",\"description\":\"Returns contract creator address and transaction hash (up to 10 contracts per request)\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=contract\u0026action=getcontractcreation\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/contract/get-contract-creator-and-creation-transaction-hash\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get List of Contracts\",\"description\":\"Returns list of contracts sorted by creation time. Can filter by verification status.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=contract\u0026action=listcontracts\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/contract/get-list-of-contracts\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Verify Contract with Source Code\",\"description\":\"Verify a contract with its source code and compilation information. Returns a guid for checking verification status.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=contract\u0026action=verify\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/contract/verify-contract-with-source-code\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Verify Contract via Sourcify\",\"description\":\"Verify a contract through Sourcify. If already verified on Sourcify fetches from repo.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=contract\u0026action=verify_via_sourcify\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/contract/verify-contract-via-sourcify\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Verify Vyper Contract\",\"description\":\"Verify a Vyper contract with its source code and compilation information.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=contract\u0026action=verify_vyper_contract\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/contract/verify-vyper-contract\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Verify Contract with Standard JSON Input\",\"description\":\"Verify a contract using Standard JSON Input or flattened source code.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=contract\u0026action=verifysourcecode\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/contract/verify-contract-with-standard-json-input\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Check Verification Status\",\"description\":\"Returns status of a verification attempt. guid is received from verify or verifysourcecode methods.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=contract\u0026action=checkverifystatus\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/contract/check-verification-status\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Verify Proxy Contract\",\"description\":\"Verify that a contract is a proxy contract pointing to an implementation.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=contract\u0026action=verifyproxycontract\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/contract/verify-proxy-contract\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Check Proxy Verification Status\",\"description\":\"Returns status of a proxy contract verification attempt.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=contract\u0026action=checkproxyverification\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/contract/check-proxy-verification-status\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Logs\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Get Event Logs by Address/Topics/Block Range\",\"description\":\"Returns event logs for an address and topic combination.\\nUp to a maximum of 1,000 event logs.\\nUse topic operators (and/or) to specify topic retrieval options.\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=logs\u0026action=getLogs\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/logs/get-event-logs-by-addresstopicsblock-range\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Stats\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Get ERC-20 or ERC-721 Token Total Supply\",\"description\":\"Returns the total supply of an ERC-20 or ERC-721 token by contract address\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=stats\u0026action=tokensupply\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/stats/get-erc-20-or-erc-721-token-total-supply\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Total Supply of Native Token\",\"description\":\"Returns the total supply of the native token (e.g., ETH, xDai)\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=stats\u0026action=ethsupply\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/stats/get-total-supply-of-native-token\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Native Token Price\",\"description\":\"Returns the price of the native token in USD and BTC\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=stats\u0026action=ethprice\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/stats/get-native-token-price\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Total Supply from Exchange\",\"description\":\"Returns total supply in Wei from exchange data.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=stats\u0026action=ethsupplyexchange\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/stats/get-total-supply-from-exchange\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Total Coin Supply from DB\",\"description\":\"Returns total coin supply from database minus burnt tokens.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=stats\u0026action=coinsupply\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/stats/get-total-coin-supply-from-db\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Native Coin Price\",\"description\":\"Returns latest price of native coin in USD and BTC.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=stats\u0026action=coinprice\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/stats/get-native-coin-price\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Total Transaction Fees\",\"description\":\"Returns total transaction fees in Wei paid by users to validators per day.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=stats\u0026action=totalfees\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/stats/get-total-transaction-fees\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Token\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Get Token Info\",\"description\":\"Returns info on name, symbol, supply and type for a token contract address\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=token\u0026action=getToken\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/token/get-token-info\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Token Holders\",\"description\":\"Returns an array of token holder accounts and amounts held for a specified token\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=token\u0026action=getTokenHolders\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/token/get-token-holders\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Bridged Tokens List\",\"description\":\"Returns array of bridged token information from native bridge application.\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=token\u0026action=bridgedTokenList\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/token/get-bridged-tokens-list\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"Transaction\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Get Transaction Info by Transaction Hash\",\"description\":\"Returns transaction information including revert reason if available\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=transaction\u0026action=gettxinfo\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/transaction/get-transaction-info-by-transaction-hash\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Transaction Receipt Status\",\"description\":\"Returns the status of a transaction receipt.\\nAlso available through a GraphQL 'transaction' query.\\nStatus: 0 = failed, 1 = successful\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=transaction\u0026action=gettxreceiptstatus\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/transaction/get-transaction-receipt-status\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true},{\"title\":\"Get Transaction Execution Status\",\"description\":\"Returns transaction execution status with error description if applicable.\\nAlso available through a GraphQL 'transaction' query.\\nisError: 0 = pass (no error), 1 = error\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml get /?module=transaction\u0026action=getstatus\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/transaction/get-transaction-execution-status\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]},{\"group\":\"ETH RPC\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Ethereum JSON-RPC endpoint\",\"description\":\"Single endpoint for all standard Ethereum JSON-RPC 2.0 methods. Send a POST request with a JSON body specifying the `method` and `params`.\\n\\n**Supported methods:** `eth_blockNumber`, `eth_getBalance`, `eth_getLogs`, `eth_gasPrice`, `eth_getTransactionByHash`, `eth_getTransactionReceipt`, `eth_chainId`, `eth_maxPriorityFeePerGas`, `eth_getTransactionCount`, `eth_getCode`, `eth_getStorageAt`, `eth_estimateGas`, `eth_getBlockByNumber`, `eth_getBlockByHash`, `eth_sendRawTransaction`, `eth_call`\\n\\n**Example:**\\n```\\ncurl -H \\\"content-type: application/json\\\" -X POST \\\\\\n  --data '{\\\"id\\\":0,\\\"jsonrpc\\\":\\\"2.0\\\",\\\"method\\\":\\\"eth_blockNumber\\\",\\\"params\\\":[]}' \\\\\\n  https://eth.blockscout.com/api/eth-rpc\\n```\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/openapi-specs/jsonrpc-endpoints.yaml post /eth-rpc\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/eth-rpc/ethereum-json-rpc-endpoint\",\"autogeneratedByOpenApi\":true}]}]}]},{\"title\":\"GraphQL in Blockscout\",\"description\":\"Query Blockscout blockchain data with GraphQL, a typed query language that lets clients request the exact transaction and address fields they need.\",\"icon\":\"tachograph-digital\",\"href\":\"/devs/apis/graphql\"}]}]},{\"tab\":\"About Blockscout\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"About Blockscout\",\"href\":\"/about/features\"}]}]},\"maps\":{\"firstHrefInVersion\":{},\"firstHrefInLanguage\":{}},\"children\":\"$L2b\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2c:I[763509,[\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/7578c347033fb4c7.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/b664fc8bb1e7ab0d.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/31aff92bfbdfee60.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/eefca33900b5dff8.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/761250e423ee7acf.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/e6405b7bcea25597.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/8048dcef7298cf99.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/526cb488b5bfc024.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/f3f176bab80ffeb4.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/f3d21b56325afeb2.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/34741e9da93fcfba.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/15da0bd8d2646d24.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/e7cb103ff122456f.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/7fa450b5031b4866.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/5656ef4b9c65e1f2.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/2c09d2adf26e1020.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/e7b3b3d7bd4f285c.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/chunks/bf62f3a2927aa603.js?dpl=dpl_rt5zycAiPA8E8KN5yhdeaJYM57Si\",\"/mintlify-assets/_next/static/